sdiv5: x / 5, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-12, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-12 to where the program needs x / 5, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 5 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 3 cells. It runs 3 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-12: 2x / 10
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     401      SFT 01
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
